Offline machine-translation models bundled in /app/mt-models
=============================================================

The GMED offline translation service (app/mt_api.py) uses the following
OPUS-MT models by the Language Technology Research Group at the University of
Helsinki (Helsinki-NLP), trained on OPUS data. Each model was downloaded from
the Hugging Face Hub at the pinned revision below. Changes: the weights were
converted to the CTranslate2 format with int8 quantization
(app/build_mt_models.py); no fine-tuning was applied. The SentencePiece files
are copied verbatim.

